<p>上表例子中「韭」字以上俗字的筆劃多，「來」字以下正字的筆劃多。其中，「䏣」、「虵」、「㛐」今天不通行；今「然」、「燃」及「華」、「花」兩字分化。
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="正字與異形字"><span id=".E6.AD.A3.E5.AD.97.E8.88.87.E7.95.B0.E5.BD.A2.E5.AD.97"></span>正字與異形字</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%BC%82%E4%BD%93%E5%AD%97&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="編輯章節：正字與異形字"><span>編輯</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb"><a href="/wiki/File:%22Kai_Tak%22_road_signs_in_Sun_Po_Kong,_Hong_Kong_%E7%95%B0%E9%AB%94%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%88%E5%95%9F%E2%80%93%E5%95%93%EF%BC%89.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/%22Kai_Tak%22_road_signs_in_Sun_Po_Kong%2C_Hong_Kong_%E7%95%B0%E9%AB%94%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%88%E5%95%9F%E2%80%93%E5%95%93%EF%BC%89.jpg/250px-%22Kai_Tak%22_road_signs_in_Sun_Po_Kong%2C_Hong_Kong_%E7%95%B0%E9%AB%94%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%88%E5%95%9F%E2%80%93%E5%95%93%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="250" height="141" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/%22Kai_Tak%22_road_signs_in_Sun_Po_Kong%2C_Hong_Kong_%E7%95%B0%E9%AB%94%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%88%E5%95%9F%E2%80%93%E5%95%93%EF%BC%89.jpg/500px-%22Kai_Tak%22_road_signs_in_Sun_Po_Kong%2C_Hong_Kong_%E7%95%B0%E9%AB%94%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%88%E5%95%9F%E2%80%93%E5%95%93%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="3840" data-file-height="2160" /></a><figcaption>位於香港<a href="/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E8%92%B2%E5%B4%97" title="新蒲崗">新蒲崗</a>的這兩塊路牌都指向<a href="/wiki/%E5%95%9F%E5%BE%B7" title="啟德">啟德</a>，但分別用了「啟」和「啓」字。</figcaption></figure>
